    <string name="guide_steps_xiaomi">1. Turn on autostart for ApexApp.\n2. Under Battery saver, choose No restrictions for ApexApp.\n3. In Recents, lock the app with the padlock.</string>
    <string name="guide_steps_huawei">1. Under App launch, turn off automatic management for ApexApp.\n2. Turn on auto-launch, secondary launch and run in background.</string>
    <string name="guide_steps_oppo">1. Allow auto-start for ApexApp.\n2. Under Battery, allow background activity.\n3. Lock the app in Recents.</string>
    <string name="guide_steps_vivo">1. Allow auto-start for ApexApp.\n2. Under Battery, allow background power use.\n3. Add ApexApp to the allowed high-consumption apps.</string>
    <string name="guide_steps_samsung">1. Under Battery, open Background usage limits.\n2. Remove ApexApp from sleeping apps and add it to never sleeping apps.</string>
    <string name="guide_steps_oneplus">1. Allow auto-start for ApexApp.\n2. Under Battery, choose Dont optimize for ApexApp.\n3. Lock the app in Recents.</string>

